fishing_random_thoughts: {
	"&7&oWell, this is boring.",
	"&7&oWhy am I even doing this?",
	"&7&oHoping for some good loot, I guess.",
	"&7&oAm I crazy?",
	"&7&oThere don't seem to be fish in these waters.",
	"&7&oWhere's the fish?",
	"&7&oThis is an odd task for a nightmare scenario.",
	"&7&oWhy do they let me fish? And then catch anything but fish?",
	"&7&oThese waters need some cleaning. Should I clean them?",
	"&7&oIs this really the only thing the devs could think of? Fishing?!?!",
	"&7&oI'm extremely bored and want to do something else.",
	"&7&oDoes God speak French?",
	"&7&oAre you talking to yourself, or am I talking to you... wait who's talking?",
	"&7&oSometimes I notice that weird logo on the exterminators' gear. What could it mean?",
	"&7&oI'm glad it's always night time. It makes fishing convenient. Wait- That's not normal.",
	"&7&oApparently there was this doctor who experimented with the Plague and an infant. Is that what started this?",
	"&7&oIt's really peaceful and hidden away up here. Super convenient for avoiding psychopathic murderers.",
	"&7&oWe didn't get much useful stuff from those crates over there. Funny.",
	"&7&oWhy do I have a strong hatred for cats all of a sudden? Wait, now it's gone.",
	"&7&oI have these weird dreams where I'm the exterminator.",
	"&7&oThis reminds me of that movie with the buff killer robot. Man that was cool.",
	"&7&oThe words 'by' and 'day' are stuck in my head.",
	"&7&oThis probably took a while to code. Maybe I should support the devs.",
	"&7&oI'm glad I read the tutorial.",
	"&7&oWhat are those signs past the tunnel?",
	"&7&oI wonder what it's like on the top of the tree.",
	"&7&oFor an apocolypse, this is pretty relaxing. For now at least.",
	"&7&oWOAH POGFISH",
	"&7&oMost of us were born with the Plague.",
	"&7&oKagome~ Kagome~ Who is that behind you?",
	"&7&oFrozen frog actually tastes good. That little tomboyish girl was right.",
	"&7&oMr. Raccoon, Mr. Raccoon, will you come and play with me~?",
	"&7&oI'm kind of hungry.",
	"&7&oI remember when Fleetfooted was meta. Funny days.",
	"&7&oCan you feel the sunshine? Does it brighten up your day~?",
	"&7&oThis water feels unusually nice. But, it is water...?",
	"&7&oMaybe Gaston was right.",
	"&7&oYes.",
	"&7&oNo.",
	"&7&oMaybe?",
	"&7&oIf you wanted to escape, why did you get caught?",
	"&7&oI don't remember who brought us to this place, but they have style.",
	"&7&oDoes anybody else hear that screaming baby?",
	"&7&oObey and nobody gets hurt. That's what they say.",
	"&7&oIs this all my fault?",
	"&7&oI feel guilty for doing the right thing.",
	"&7&oLast chance to look at me, Hector.",
	"&7&oSay my name.",
	"&7&oTell me, what is it you truly desire?",
	"&7&oThe voices are getting louder... when will it stop?!",
	"&7&oTwo plagues. One for them, one for us.",
	"&7&oThe beauty of annihilation.",
	"&7&oDo you want to play a game?",
	"&7&oYou see a note that says '74315'",
	"&7&oI could really go for an Adam Sandler movie right now.",
	"&7&oI sense the Adam Sandler Signal.",
	"&7&oI made friends with a lizard. He told a secret :)",
	"&7&oWait... is fishing just a lootbox that takes a long time to fully open?",
	"Yes I will land on my feet. I will be okay. But you? Far from it.",
	"You can't hide who you really are forever."
}

