tips: {
	"Know when to hide! The killer will often patrol around objectives.",
	"Teamwork is dream work. Coordinate actions to make de-cursing faster, and avoiding the killer easier.",
	"Occupy the Killer! It lets your team do objectives.",
	"Escape portals do not speed up if multiple survivors are working on one!",
	"When the Killer hits a survivor, they are temporarily stunned for 3 seconds. Get away fast!",
	"When you become Level 100 you can prestige, which will reset your perks.",
	"Try building your perks to work with each other to create powerful effects.",
	"Always try to go into a match with a strategy in mind so you can act efficiently and use your perks better."
	"Remember that the opponents could just be having a really lucky day!",
	"Use corners and cover to deceive the Killer. Stealth can make the difference between life and death!",
	"Remember that you can use your Blood to buy perks, augments and cosmetics!",
	"You can join our discord with /discord!",
	"A good perk build reflects how you play! Pick perks that synergies with other perks.",
	"Be patient. You never know when an opportunity will arise.",
	"No one is too cool to read /tutorial.",
	"Be careful around corners. One wrong turn can get you seriously hurt!",
	"If your teammates are in chase but low health, help them out. More survivors alive is always better!",
	"Use /report to report rule-breakers!",
	"You can sneak over The Scrubber's traps to prevent them from triggering!",
	"The Cloaker can appear from anywhere. Keep a look out!",
	"The Hunter can be thrown off by being hard to predict. Swerve and stay out of Line of Sight!",
	"The Warper is slower than survivors, you can (technically) outrun them!",
	"Jack o' Lantern's Dark Steed cannot go through small doorways!",
	"Necromancer's minions can be destroyed!",
	"Use Augments to change your Killer Ability!",
	"You can link your Minecraft account with the Discord using /verify!",
	"Prestiging changes the color of your Level in chat!",
	"You can heal your teammates by crouching and right-clicking them!",
	"On certain days of the week, different events will happen. Try participating in them!",
	"Use headphones for the best experience!",
	"Hearing music and don't want to? Do '/music off' to disable it!"
}
rules: {
	"&b&lRULES\n&7These describe our server rules. If you have any issues, please talk to staff.",
	"&c1. &8You cannot use client modifications to purposefully gain an unfair advantage. Performance mods are allowed, but mods that change how your player interacts with the world or display unfair information are forbidden.",
	"&c2. &8If you find something that isn't acting as intended, we suggest you report it. Do not abuse bugs for your advantage.",
	"&c3. &8You cannot advertise anything. Sharing links to other media must be relevant to the discussion and cannot contain NSFW content.",
	"&c4. &8Do not convincingly impersonate anyone. If in jest, it's fine, but just make it obvious you're joking.",
	"&c5. &8Killers cannot team with any survivors. &lAlthough sparing the last survivor is not considered teaming.",
	"&c6. &8Keep chat behaviour reasonable. Don't flood chat, spam, hurl insults and any other general toxicity, or annoy people.",
	"&c7. &8Do not intentionally throw the game for your team. Being AFK during a match repeatedly may count as throwing the game. If you are AFK, don't queue.",
	"&c8. &8Do not abuse our Discord integration. Do not ask users for their /verify codes, and do not hijack codes for accounts that aren't yours."
	"That's all, folks!\n\nStaff will enforce rules at their discretion. If you think you did nothing wrong, join our discord to appeal."
}
guide: {
	"&d&lWelcome to the Deadlight Guide!\n&0We've compiled all the knowledge you need to know about Deadlight :D",
	"&a&l&nSurvivor\n\n&0Your objective is to uncurse &d5 Soul Sand&0. Hold Right-click on &dSoul Sand&0 to start uncursing.",
	"&a&l&nSurvivor\n\n&0Once all &d5&0 objectives are completed, you can power &dat least 1 of 2 Exit Portals&0 to escape, which look like Redstone Lamps. These take time to power, so hold right-click on them until they are fully powered.",
	"&a&l&nSurvivor\n\n&0If you shift and hold right-click on your injured allies, you can heal them!",
	"&a&l&nSurvivor\n\n&0When you die, you drop a &dSoul&0. Another player can pick this up with right-click and place it on an &dCompleted Portal Fragment&0 to revive you. This can only happen once per survivor!",
	"&c&l&nKiller\n\n&0Your objective is to kill all survivors and prevent escape by any means necessary. Break Soul Sand to sabotage their progress!",
	"&c&l&nKiller\n\n&0Survivors tend to be around objectives, so if you can't find any, search around the &dSoul Sand&0 to find them.",
	"&c&l&nKiller\n\n&0Select a Killer Type to change your abilities. Abilities help you catch survivors off guard and seal their fate.",
	"&c&l&nKiller\n\n&0If you see a survivor being revived on a &6Completed Portal Fragment&0, left click it to destroy the soul and stop the revive.",
	"The next pages are more advanced knowledge, so if you want to continue to learn the server, please continue reading. Otherwise, you should know enough to be able to play!."
	"&b&l&nFishing\n\n&0You can go fishing using &b/fishing&0. You gain items, offerings, blood, and souls from fishing, good stuff!",
	"&4&l&nObsession\n\n&0The obsession has a lunar (&4˜½&0) symbol around their name. The Obsession has point bonuses if killed, or they escape.",
	"&4&l&nObsession\n\n&0Some perks affect the obsession in different ways, so keep an eye out for who the obsession is.",
	"&6&l&nEnd Game Collapse\n\n&0After all objectives are completed, the match timer will disappear, being replaced with the End Game Collapse.",
	"&6&l&nEnd Game Collapse\n\n&0Both killers and survivors have 2 minutes to complete their final objectives, or the arena collapses. The Killer recieves points for any survivors who die in the collapse.",
	"&d&l&nLoadout\n\n&0You can use the slimeball named &dCustomize Kit&0 or &d/kit&0 to change your perks, items, ability, and cosmetics. These can help you define your own playstyle!",
	"&4&l&nStatus Effects\n\n&0"
#	"&0&l&nLore\n\n&0We've hidden some stuff around spawn and maps. Maybe you can explore a bit and piece together what happened.",
	"That's all folks! Do &6/queue&0 or right click the item in your inventory. If you have specific questions that this tutorial does not answer, ask in chat.\n\n&nRead our Rules: &6/rules",
}

tutorial_message: "&aPlease read the tutorial carefully and ask questions if you don't know!"
tutorial: {
	"&9Welcome to Deadlight!\n&8(Inspired by DBD)\n&0This is a short, basic tutorial that you should read to get the gist on how to play!\n\nYou may do /guide for a more in-depth tutorial later!",
	"&a&l&nSURVIVOR\n\n&0Hold right click on Soul Sand (Fragments) to uncurse it.\n\nWhen you uncurse all 5 Fragments, you unlock the Exit Portals (Redstone Lamps) Which will glow.\n\nDon't let the Killer catch you!",
	"&4&l&nKILLER\n\n&0Kill the survivors, and stop them from uncursing fragments.\n\nDestroy the Fragments to Sabotage them, which will drain their progress until the survivors interact again.",
	"&a&lCUSTOMIZATION\n\n&0After reading this, you will be given 50k blood to buy Perks-\n\nEquippable abilities that give you certain listed effects.\n\nThat's all! Read /guide for more info!"
}
