# A shitty salesman who is also a sea monster...
npc_sea_monster: {
	"It's hard to catch fish with your mouth. That's why I use a Fishing Rod!",
	"This pond is full of treasure, and none of which are any good fish.",
	"If you don't rent my Fishing Rods, I will eat you. Just kidding, of course!",
	"The Plague can do interesting things to a person. It even affects water, maybe...",
	"The water is cursed with goodies! Or is it blessed? Eh, might as well get what you can!",
	"Being a monster of the sea means I have to sell Fishing Rods. What a terrible life!",
	"The cheaper rods are for a low price. Go big or go... small!",
	"Oysters are a delicious food. Or not, I haven't tried them.",
	"jerry is such a cool fish!",
	"larry is such a disappointing fish.",
	"bob is a pufferfish, and admires jerry with a passion. Almost strangely.",
	"It seems like the devs needed an NPC for fishing and found a sea monster skin that fit good enough. Weird.",
	"My real name is &kseamonster lmfao&f, but you can just call me Sea Monster.",
	"I'll tell you what, if you rent my fishing rods now, i'll give you 0% off!",
	"My flesh is melting, and so will yours if you don't rent my fishing rods.",
	"The only thing I have left is these fishing rods, so please rent some.",
	"RENT MY FISHING RODS, PLEASE!!",
	"Fishing rods are your key resources to fishing. Your hands don't work that well!",
	"I talk to every customer. Nobody ever responds :(",
	"I'm scared of turtles. They look weird!",
	"Who decided to make sea snakes? Bleh! Tell them that was a terrible idea!",
	"*nods* you look like you could use a FISHING ROD!",
	"*screaming* buy a fishing rod *continues screaming*",
	"i don't care if you're broke, buy a fishing rod!",
	"Longer fishing rod times give you a discount! HOORAY!",
	"This pond has some spooky stuff inside of it.",
	"GOBBLE GOBBLE!",
	"&osoon may the wellerman come, to bring us sugar and tea and rum&f. Oh, sorry, a nice tune I learned at sea is stuck in my head!",
	"I used to be a pirate, then I fell off my boat and became a salesman! Stealing isn't really my thing anyway.",
	"One time I saw a huge sea monster! I got really jealous.",
	"Have you talked to anyone with an tentacle beard recently? I haven't seen Davy in forever!",
	"The contamination of the water is probably just litter.",
	"If you offer the Big Bass, I'll drop my prices by a whole 15%! What a steal!",
	"I've never left my pirate ways, just like how I've never seen a movie and paid.",
	"&opsst- hey, kid, if your fishing rod ever breaks, I also sell duct tape..."
}

npc_challenges: {
	"I have some challenges for you!",
	"Hey, do you have some time to do some chores?",
	"Keeping a daily routine can be healthy for the mind!",
	"Here's a list of things I need you to do for me.",
	"I'd do these myself but I'm a bit busy making a list for tomorrow.",
	"I'll reward you greatly if you can do a few things for me.",
	"Just a few things for today. Can ya get em done for me?",
}
