# A person who wants to save all the survivors
npc_akura: {
	"Whispers in the night will tell you all you need to know.",
	"We will come back for you. This prison isn't for you.",
	"Remember, &4&kAkura&f will save you. Don't give up.",
	"They don't keep people here for long.",
	"You aren't safe here. We will set you free.",
	"They are liars. We are the truth.",
	"You won't die here, we won't let them kill you.",
	"Stay away from those monsters. They want us dead.",
	"Don't trust anyone. They are not your friends; they are your executioners.",
	"You deserve a second chance, don't let them take it from you.",
	"Don't be scared, we got your back.",
	"There is hope for you, just trust us.",
	"Keep calm, it'll all be worth it.",
	"We can get you out. Soon.",
}

npc_akura_shop: {
	"I've got supplies to help you.",
	"Get what you need.",
	"The night will be of great fortune.",
	"I'll use the resources to get you better items.",
	"These will keep you be safe.",
	"A parting gift from me.",
	"Keep it hidden, don't let them know you have it.",
	"Anything you need, I'm willing to sell.",
	"We've smuggled some new items in for you.",
	"The flowers just blossomed!"
}

# The Plague in a "physical" form.
# written when i was in a really dark place.
# The monster is simply a hallucination and embodiment of your darkest thoughts.
npc_demon: {
	"What are you hiding? You have nothing left.",
	"You are the real monster.",
	"You will all be dead by next year.",
	"You are powerless.",
	"Nobody is here to save you.",
	"You've done this to yourself.", 
	"Who's the real monster here?",
	"There is nothing to live for, you are a burden on them.",
	"Give up, you have gone far enough.",
	"What's the matter? Too scared to die?",
	"Weaklings like you are the reason we are all here.",
	"This is simply a game of cat and mouse, and you are all mice.",
	"Look at yourself. What even are you, really?",
	"They should've killed you when they had the chance. Too bad they took pity on you.",
	"Do you know where survivors go after they escape? Back to the tree. There was never an escape.",
	"What hope they had, its going to be gone soon.",
	"Let them do what they want, you can't fight it.",
	"The ground has been poisoned with your misdeeds.",
	"Is your life even worth living? Some would say you're too far gone.",
	"Can someone like you really be redeemed?",
	"You are the reason we are not okay. You are the reason this Plague is spreading.",
	"Do you even know what The Plague is?",
	"Is it any wonder we're all broken?",
	"Heartless.",
	"Don't lie to me, I won't lie to you.",
	"There is no escape. Might as well scream for your final moments. There is nothing left to live for.",
	"If only you had the guts to escape. You would be out of here already.",
	"Don't worry about going to hell. You're already here.",
	"Remember what you did? All those people you hurt? Could you imagine who they think you are?",
	"It's hard to complain when my existence is because of you.",
	"When the night fades, you'll remember why you couldn't sleep.",
	"Things look bad now, just wait until later. I'll show you real chaos.",
	"Die a hero or live long enough to become the villian. Lucky you, you lived too long.",
}

# Exterminator Crescent. of the C.C.C.'s Dark Command team.
npc_crescent: {
	"Welcome. Don't make too much of a mess now.",
	"I can tell you're looking at my armor. Rest assured, you're safe here.",
	"I've seen what the CCC is actually doing. They're not trying to cure anything.",
	"The CCC just wants to control The Plague. Nothing more.",
	"Down there is your escape path, if push comes to shove. You'd best familiarize yourself with it.",
	"This outpost is your safe spot. They won't try anything here.",
	"I'm studying the Fragments and Portals. You wanna know why? Did &kAkura&f give you that key?",
	"Are you going out? Be careful.",
	"That armor over there? It belongs to me.",
	"The fish are real. Please feed them if something ever happens to me."
}

